"section": "Dataset",
"field": "LCI Assumptions",
"value": "Electricity for electrolysis will be sourced from renewable (electricity production, wind, 1-3MW turbine, onshore, DE) from ecoinvent database. | Electrolysis efficiency was assumed as 58%, based on literature values for alkaline electrolysis. Fischer-Tropsch synthesis efficiency was assumed as 70 to 80%. | Environmental burdens allocated among co-products based on mass or energy content, with synthetic fuels are not considered in this study. | Transport of fuels is not considered in the system boundary."
},
